[E0414] Error: cannot assign to `slot` while the bindings of a `val` pattern refer to it
    ╭─[ err/84_guard_borrows/main.wip:19:9 ]
    │
 16 │         val .Some(token) = slot else {
    │                            ──┬─  
    │                              ╰─── matched here; the bindings refer to it until the block ends
    │ 
 19 │         slot = .None
    │         ──┬─  
    │           ╰─── assigned here
    │ 
    │ Note: the bindings of `val pattern = place else { … }` are aliases for its fields, so the place must not change until the block ends
